Well, my reasoning for that is that Medusa petrifies you because she's
damn ugly. (IIRC when cancelling her you get a message about her not
being that ugly at all). So eating is a lot worse than just looking into
her face.

By swallowing her she goes right into you stomach. Burp and gone.
Nothing much to worry about.

But Nethack's Medusa is special, and that's just my toughts...

> Is it just me, or is this a bug?  It's a gaze, right?  

I don't like that gaze. Someone added a gaze-attack to her monster
structure. And someone made that her gaze-attack in combat doesn't do
anything and put her stoning ability elsewhere, which made her stoning
work quite mythological.

And when I complained that
  "petrified by deliberately gazing at Medusa's hideous countenance" 
doesn't fit onto the tombstone it got changed to:
  "petrified by meeting Medusa's gaze"

I'm not really happy about that...


